# Build context for Dockerfile.api (repo root). P4.S1.
#
# Docker honours ONLY full-line `#` comments — a `#` after a pattern is part of
# the pattern and silently stops it matching. Every comment here is on its own
# line for that reason.
#
# Two things in this file are correctness, not size: `.env*` (a real secret must
# never enter a layer) and the two `!` negations at the bottom (two directories
# the RUNNING app reads from disk).

# --- correctness: secrets and host-shaped artifacts ---
.env
.env.*
# The mac virtualenv: linux wheels are resolved from uv.lock inside the image.
.venv
.python-version
*.zip

# --- the frontend: its own build context (frontend/Dockerfile) ---
frontend
node_modules

# --- the agentic workspace and everything else the service never reads ---
.git
.github
.githooks
.claude
works
tests
scripts
var
evalset
docs
.pytest_cache
.ruff_cache
__pycache__
*.egg-info
*.pyc
.DS_Store
Makefile
CLAUDE.md
compose.yaml
compose.prod.yml
executors.toml

# --- re-included: read from disk by the running app ---
# `mijual.evalset` resolves EVALSET_DIR = MIJUAL_ROOT/"evalset" and the ops
# 정확도 tab loads both frozen artifacts at request time (`opsreads.accuracy`).
# Excluding them turns that signed tab into its empty state.
!evalset/labels.json
!evalset/sample.json
# The ops 개요 tab's 가동 전 미결 panel quotes this one doc verbatim
# (`opsreads.open_decisions`). No other doc is read by any request path.
!docs/current/decisions.md
